 "_doc": "凭证身份跨语言样例：backend/app/services/voucher_identity.py 与 audit-platform/frontend/src/utils/voucherIdentity.ts 读同一份，输出逐字相同（spec voucher-identity-writeback-and-audit-phase 需求 1.4）。",
